        opts.materialHash,
        CODEX_REVIEW_CONCURRENCY_CAP_EXCEEDED,
        `Codex review leaf refused pre-spawn: concurrency_cap_exceeded (cap ${cap}, every host-run slot held by a live run); the codex runner was never invoked.`,
